^warning: ignoring
--
differential2 §12c. A list comprehension over a runtime list (a list
parameter with symbolic length) is lowered to a GOTO while-loop that
populates a temporary, rather than being dropped. Element computation
and `if` filters are modeled; the element expression's own checks are
emitted inside the loop body (guarded by the iteration) so out-of-
range slots don't raise spurious exceptions.
